  "title": "Changing the domain name for an existing deployment",
  "summary": "I installed openreplay with a domain name that I’d now like to change. I see openreplay -–edit allows me to change the domain name, but doing so doesn’t seem to propagate to the wide variety of Ingress/Deployment resources that are still using the old name. Do I have to update all of these one by one? Is there a better way to change the domain name on an existing deployment?",
